  "description": {
   "en": "Satoko, the eldest daughter of the Nakahara family, graduated from a junior college and started her new working life. However, her father, Shuzo, is worried about Satoko, even though he pretends to be calm. Despite her father's worries, Satoko is working hard in love, friendship, and work. This is a heartwarming story about Satoko, a new office worker, and her stubborn and kind father, Shuzo. \n\n(google translated)"
